    title: "How Much Does a 2-Car Garage Cost? A Full Breakdown",
    metaTitle: "How Much Does a 2-Car Garage Cost? A 2026 Price Guide",
    description:
      "Wondering how much does a 2-car garage cost? Get a clear breakdown of prices, key factors, and tips to plan your garage project with confidence.",
