    slug: "greenhouse-buying-guide-beginners",
    title: "Greenhouse Buying Guide for Beginners: Size, Material, and Style",
    metaTitle: "Greenhouse Buying Guide: Find the Perfect Size and Style",
    description:
      "Get a free greenhouse buying guide for beginners exploring size, material, and style. Compare backyard options and find the best fit for your garden.",
    image: "/images/blog/greenhouse-buying-guide-beginners.webp",
