    slug: "a-frame-cabin-buyers-guide",
    title: "A-Frame Cabin Buyer's Guide: Find Your A Frame Cabin for Sale",
    metaTitle: "A Frame Cabin for Sale in NY: A Complete Buyer's Guide",
    description: "Call Stephen Kanagy at Legacy Structures for a frame cabin for sale in upstate NY. Compare A-frame cabin styles, sizes, and rent-to-own options.",
    image: "/images/blog/a-frame-cabin-buyers-guide.webp",
    imageAlt: "Modern pre-built A-frame cabin in a forested upstate New York setting with warm interior light",
