    slug: "custom-shed-cost-pricing-guide",
    title: "What Does a Custom Shed Cost? A Complete Pricing Guide",
    metaTitle: "How Much Does a Custom Shed Cost in NY? A Pricing Guide",
    description:
      "Get a transparent look at custom shed cost in the Hudson Falls NY area, from size and siding to rent-to-own payments, backed by a 5-year warranty.",
    image: "/images/blog/custom-shed-cost-pricing-guide.webp",
